hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"19212","Yazid ibn Harun narrated to us, he said: Yahya ibn Said informed us from Bushayr ibn Yasar from al-Husayn ibn Mihsan that a paternal aunt of his came to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) for a need, and she finished her need. The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said to her: Are you married? She said: Yes. He said: How are you to him? She said: I do not fall short except what I am unable to do. He said: Look where you are from him, for he is your Paradise and your Fire."
